---
import ArrowIcon from '../components/ArrowIcon.astro';
import SupportShell from '../components/SupportShell.astro';
const candidate=Astro.url.searchParams.get('image')||'';
const image=/^[a-z0-9-]{1,160}$/.test(candidate)?candidate:'';
---
<SupportShell title="Commercial licensing" description="A coloring page can be the start of a bigger idea. Tell us what you have in mind, and we’ll review the permissions your project needs." kind="license" eyebrow="LET’S TALK ABOUT YOUR IDEA">
 <div slot="hero" class="support-hero-meta"><span>Written permission before use</span><span>No payment on this page</span></div>
 <div class="support-card-grid">{[['01','Choose your artwork','Copy the JotColoring page links for the illustrations you want to use.'],['02','Describe your project','Tell us about the product, audience, quantity, distribution and duration.'],['03','Wait for written terms','We review available rights and confirm any permission and conditions. A draft request is not a license.']].map(([n,title,copy])=><section class="support-card"><span class="support-card-number">{n}</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>{copy}</p></section>)}</div>
 <div class="support-prose-layout"><aside class="support-toc"><h2>BEFORE YOU REQUEST</h2><nav aria-label="Commercial licensing sections"><a href="#request">Prepare your request</a><a href="#scope">What needs permission?</a><a href="#review">How review works</a><a href="/license/">Free-use license</a></nav></aside><div class="support-prose"><section id="request"><h2>Tell us about your project</h2><p>Use the fields below to prepare your project details, then review and send them through our contact form. Preparing a request does not send it or grant permission.</p></section>
 <form class="support-form" data-license-request><div class="support-form-grid"><label class="wide">Coloring page links<textarea name="pages" rows="3" maxlength="2000" required placeholder="https://jotcoloring.com/coloring/...">{image?`https://jotcoloring.com/coloring/${image}/`:''}</textarea><small>One link per line. Include every illustration in the request.</small></label><label>Your name or business<input name="name" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="120" required/></label><label>Type of use<select name="use" required><option value="">Choose your project…</option><option>Printed products or merchandise</option><option>Paid publication or activity book</option><option>Website, app or digital product</option><option>Advertising or business promotion</option><option>Commercial teaching material</option><option>Other commercial project</option></select></label><label class="wide">Project details<textarea name="details" rows="4" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="What are you making? How will the artwork be used?"/></label><label>Quantity or expected audience<input name="quantity" maxlength="160" required placeholder="For example: 200 printed copies"/></label><label>Where it will be distributed<input name="distribution" maxlength="200" required placeholder="Countries, sales channels or platforms"/></label><label>Duration<input name="duration" maxlength="120" required placeholder="For example: one print run, six months"/></label><label>Changes you want to make<input name="changes" maxlength="300" placeholder="Coloring, cropping, text or other edits"/></label></div><div class="support-actions"><button class="support-button" type="submit">Prepare My Request</button><button class="support-button secondary" type="button" data-copy-license>Copy request</button></div><p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-license-status>No payment is collected and no license is issued by this form.</p><a class="support-button secondary" data-email-license hidden>Continue to Contact Form<ArrowIcon kind="right" size={18}/></a><pre data-license-draft hidden tabindex="0" aria-label="Your license request draft" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:inherit;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:18px;padding:18px;border:1px solid #ead6c4;border-radius:12px;background:white"></pre></form>
 <section id="scope" style="margin-top:25px"><h2>Which projects need permission?</h2><p>Products for sale, paid publications, commercial apps, business advertising, resale bundles and redistribution of blank collection files need prior written permission. If you are printing for personal enjoyment or non-commercial education, start with the <a href="/license/">free-use artwork license</a>.</p></section><section id="review"><h2>Clear scope, no assumptions</h2><p>We review the specific artwork and intended use. No price, exclusivity, worldwide clearance or response deadline is promised on this page. AI-assisted elements and third-party subjects may limit the rights available.</p><p>Only a written confirmation that specifies your approved use grants the requested commercial permission. Do not start selling or publishing on the basis of an unanswered request.</p></section></div></div>
</SupportShell>
<script>import {mountLicenseRequest} from '../ui/license-request';mountLicenseRequest();</script>
